3.8.1 Navigating search results
-------------------------------

All search result buffers share the ‘spofy-search-mode’ keymap:

Key     Command                          Action
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
‘RET’   ‘spofy-search-play-item’         Play the item at point
‘a’     ‘spofy-search-view-album’        View album (*note Album view::)
‘A’     ‘spofy-search-view-artist’       View artist (*note Artist view::)
‘p’     ‘spofy-search-add-to-playlist’   Add track to a playlist
‘s’     ‘spofy-search-save’              Save item to library
‘S’     ‘spofy-search-unsave’            Remove item from library
‘g’     ‘spofy-search-refresh’           Re-run the search
‘m’     ‘spofy-search-load-more’         Load the next page of results
‘q’     ‘quit-window’                    Close the buffer

   The Spotify API returns results in pages of 20 items.  The command
‘spofy-search-load-more’ fetches the next page and appends it to the
existing results.


